        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>2024 · 美的集团ESG报告 — 专题：向零笃行 应对气候挑战</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .spread {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 2300px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  /* ============ LEFT PAGE ============ */\n  .page-left {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 50%;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #bfe6ee 0%, #cdeaf0 35%, #dff0e6 55%, #8dc63f 70%, #6fb52e 100%);\n    min-height: 1600px;\n    padding: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .page-left .header {\n    padding: 50px 0 0 105px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .topic-badge {\n    margin: 120px 0 0 105px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #00A886;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 14px 34px;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .topic-title {\n    margin: 42px 0 0 105px;\n    font-size: 52px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #00A886;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .topic-title .dark { color: #17415c; }\n  .topic-body {\n    margin: 40px 0 0 105px;\n    width: 580px;\n    font-size: 17.5px;\n    line-height: 2.15;\n    color: #1d3b4a;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .photo-area {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    height: 900px;\n  }\n  .photo-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 900px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.0);\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .page-left .page-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 105px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ RIGHT PAGE ============ */\n  .page-right {\n    width: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 50px 90px 40px 60px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 1600px;\n  }\n  .nav {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #333;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .nav span { margin-left: 22px; }\n  .nav .active {\n    color: #00A886;\n    border: 1.5px solid #00A886;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 5px 14px;\n  }\n  .sec-title {\n    margin: 130px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    color: #00A886;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .sec-body {\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 17.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  /* ---- Chart ---- */\n  .chart {\n    margin-top: 55px;\n    background: #ecf8f6;\n    padding: 45px 30px 55px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .pill {\n    background: #00A886;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    padding: 11px 34px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #6fcfc0;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #ecf8f6;\n    padding: 42px 30px 30px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .level {\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .level .pill-wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: -22px;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .cols {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 26px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .cols > div {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .connector {\n    width: 1.5px;\n    background: #6fcfc0;\n    height: 40px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .branch {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  .branch > .level { flex: 1; }\n  .tri {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 22px;\n  }\n  .tri > .level { flex: 1; }\n  .hline {\n    height: 1.5px;\n    background: #6fcfc0;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .page-right .page-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 90px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"spread\">\n\n  <!-- ================= LEFT PAGE ================= -->\n  <div class=\"page-left\">\n    <div class=\"header\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n\n    <div class=\"topic-badge\">专题</div>\n\n    <div class=\"topic-title\"><span class=\"dark\">向</span>零笃行 <span class=\"dark\">应对气候挑战</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"topic-body\">\n      气候变化是全球面临的共同挑战。为了响应国家适应气候变化的战略，美的集团参考国际可持续发展准则理事会（ISSB）发布的 IFRS S2《国际财务报告可持续披露准则第 2 号 — 气候相关披露》的披露建议，进一步完善气候变化治理框架及气候风险的识别与管理流程，识别与自身经营相关的气候变化风险与机遇并落实气候变化应对措施，助力全球气候变化治理，全面推进美的集团可持续发展。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"photo-area\">\n      <figure class=\"photo-placeholder placeholder\">\n        [Photo: 美的总部大楼与草坪湖景，占据左页下半部]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-num\">19</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= RIGHT PAGE ================= -->\n  <div class=\"page-right\">\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <span>关于本报告</span>\n      <span>走进美的</span>\n      <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n      <span class=\"active\">守护蓝色星球</span>\n      <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n      <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n      <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n      <span>附录</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-title\">治理</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-body\">\n      美的集团高度重视气候变化治理工作，将气候问题的治理纳入整体的ESG管治架构中，搭建了由董事会、ESG委员会、ESG执行组及ESG秘书处、三大ESG分委会组成的四层级气候变化治理架构，明确管理层在评估和管理气候风险方面的职责，确保对气候变化相关事宜进行妥善管理。此外，董事会薪酬与考核委员会负责对核心经营指标进行评估，这些指标涵盖了可持续发展绩效。委员会将评估结果与相关管理层的绩效紧密挂钩，并据此进行考核。\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Chart -->\n    <div class=\"chart\">\n\n      <!-- Level 1 -->\n      <div class=\"level\">\n        <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\">美的集团董事会</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <div class=\"cols\">\n            <div style=\"text-align:center;\">监督气候管理方法的有效性</div>\n            <div>监督气候议题的管理进展及表现，包括目标进度等</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"connector\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Level 2 -->\n      <div class=\"level\">\n        <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\">ESG委员会</span></div>\n        <div class=\"box\">\n          <div class=\"cols\">\n            <div>负责监督和指导美的集团气候变化相关事宜，并向董事会进行汇报</div>\n            <div>制定并检讨气候相关策略、管理及考核方法</div>\n            <div>评估气候相关风险和机遇，定期审阅与检讨气候相关的目标及主要举措</div>\n            <div>确定并管理用于识别、缓解和监测气候相关的预算、资源和投资情况</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"connector\" style=\"height:30px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"hline\" style=\"width:50%;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; width:50%; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div style=\"width:1.5px;height:26px;background:#6fcfc0;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"width:1.5px;height:26px;background:#6fcfc0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Level 3 -->\n      <div class=\"branch\">\n        <div class=\"level\">\n          <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\">ESG执行组</span></div>\n          <div class=\"box\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.95;\">推进落实与定期检讨美的集团气候变化战略及风险与机遇管理等事宜</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"level\">\n          <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\">ESG秘书处</span></div>\n          <div class=\"box\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.95;\">跟踪事业群/事业部气候相关绩效及具体管理举措的执行和实施情况</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"connector\" style=\"height:40px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"hline\" style=\"width:66%;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; width:66%; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div style=\"width:1.5px;height:26px;background:#6fcfc0;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"width:1.5px;height:26px;background:#6fcfc0;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"width:1.5px;height:26px;background:#6fcfc0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Level 4 -->\n      <div class=\"tri\">\n        <div class=\"level\">\n          <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\" style=\"font-size:15px;padding:11px 18px;\">绿色制造与碳排放管理分委会</span></div>\n          <div class=\"box\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.95;\">负责落实气候相关风险和机遇的日常管理和执行工作</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"level\">\n          <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\" style=\"font-size:15px;padding:11px 18px;\">绿色设计与产品碳足迹分委会</span></div>\n          <div class=\"box\">\n            <div class=\"cols\">\n              <div>识别气候变化相关风险、积极采取应对措施</div>\n              <div>协调各事业群/事业部，促进其有效合作</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"level\">\n          <div class=\"pill-wrap\"><span class=\"pill\" style=\"font-size:15px;padding:11px 18px;\">绿色供应与冲突矿产分委会</span></div>\n          <div class=\"box\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.95;\">评估、管理和监测气候相关问题，提供全面的分析、建议和更新内容，供董事会和ESG委员会审议</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-num\">20</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
